  <h2>Mechanisms:</h2>
  <p>Angle: invisible infrastructure + hidden dependancies. Energy systems are layered, and progress in one layer can hide vulnerability in another.</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Layering: electricity vs fuel vs materials</li>
    <li>Lock-in: no short-term substitutes. Internal combustion engine to EVs doesn't happen overnight.</li>
    <li>Stacking: new technologies build upon existing ones, new system does not remove old one (More and More and More by Jean-Baptiste Fressoz)</li>
    <li>Exposure: what happens under stress</li>
  </ol>
